(
    version: 2,
    note: Some("SCP-9191\'s architecture over the Site kit\'s measurements. Originally generated, but that generator no longer exists anywhere in the tree — hand-maintained now. tests/site_descriptors.rs checks the heights these patches produce."),
    // `face_bands` used to live here and no longer does: the lattice is a property of the PROJECT,
    // not of one kit's policy, because two kits disagreeing about how finely a face is read have
    // faces that cannot be compared. It is declared once in `assets/emerge/kits.ron` under
    // `lattice:`, at the same value this file carried (1).
